<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS3" title="In 4. Results ‣ Invisible Saboteurs: Sycophantic LLMs Mislead Novices in Problem-Solving Tasks" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">4.3</span> </span><span class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">RQ1: Sycophancy Reinforce Misconceptions in Mental Models</span></span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS4" title="In 4. Results ‣ Invisible Saboteurs: Sycophantic LLMs Mislead Novices in Problem-Solving Tasks" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">4.4</span> </span><span class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">RQ2: Sycophancy Results in Higher Rates of Over-Reliance</span></span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS5" title="In 4. Results ‣ Invisible Saboteurs: Sycophantic LLMs Mislead Novices in Problem-Solving Tasks" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">4.5</span> </span><span class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">RQ3: Sycophancy is Largely Unnoticed and Unmitigated</span></span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S5" title="In Invisible Saboteurs: Sycophantic LLMs Mislead Novices in Problem-Solving Tasks" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">5</span> </span><span class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Discussion</span></span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S6" title="In Invisible Saboteurs: Sycophantic LLMs Mislead Novices in Problem-Solving Tasks" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">6</span> </span><span class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Conclusion</span></span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_section">
