<p id="A1.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Sample Performance Metrics.</span></p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.F1" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2510.03667v1/img/get_performance.jpg" id="A1.F1.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:286/177;" width="286" height="177" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A1.F1.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure A.1</span>. </span><span id="A1.F1.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Performance information about the model that participants saw during the task, including accuracy, precision, recall, and F1-score of both classes and for both the training and testing datasets.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
