</span></td>
<td id="A6.T2.7.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle" style="padding-top:1.4pt;padding-bottom:1.4pt;">
<span id="A6.T2.7.3.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:355.7pt;">
