</section>
<section id="A7" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix G </span>Additional RQ1 Results</h2>

<div id="A7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A7.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Figure </span><a href="#A7.F1" title="Figure G.1 ‣ Appendix G Additional RQ1 Results ‣ Invisible Saboteurs: Sycophantic LLMs Mislead Novices in Problem-Solving Tasks" class="ltx_ref" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">G.1</span></a><span id="A7.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> shows the transition matrix of the count of correct beliefs measure pre-chatbot use and post-chatbot use. The matrices are significantly different between conditions, with the main attribution being that the </span><span id="A7.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0080FF;">Low<span id="A7.p1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_serif"> </span>Sycophancy</span><span id="A7.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> chatbot turned more </span><span id="A7.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">wrong</span><span id="A7.p1.1.6" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> beliefs into </span><span id="A7.p1.1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">neutral</span><span id="A7.p1.1.8" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> or </span><span id="A7.p1.1.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">correct</span><span id="A7.p1.1.10" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> beliefs.</span></p>
</div>
<figure id="A7.F1" class="ltx_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
<figure id="A7.F1.fig1" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><img src="2510.03667v1/syc_heatmap_v2.png" id="A7.F1.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/381;" width="476" height="381" alt="Refer to caption">
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
<figure id="A7.F1.fig2" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><img src="2510.03667v1/corr_heatmap_v2.png" id="A7.F1.g2" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/381;" width="476" height="381" alt="Refer to caption">
</figure></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A7.F1.10" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure G.1</span>. </span><span id="A7.F1.11" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Pre- and post-chatbot beliefs in the <span id="A7.F1.11.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Mental Model Quiz</span> split into categories of wrong (confidence <math id="A7.F1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&lt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">&lt;</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&lt;0</annotation></semantics></math>), neutral (confidence <math id="A7.F1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">=0</annotation></semantics></math>), and correct (confidence <math id="A7.F1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">&gt;</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>). A chi-square test of independence reveals significant difference in the distribution of the counts of the transition matrix <math id="A7.F1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\chi^{2}(8,N=576)=21.79,p=.005" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">χ</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">8</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">N</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">576</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">21.79</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">p</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">.005</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\chi^{2}(8,N=576)=21.79,p=.005</annotation></semantics></math></span></figcaption>
</figure>
<div id="A7.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A7.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Figure </span><a href="#A7.F2" title="Figure G.2 ‣ Appendix G Additional RQ1 Results ‣ Invisible Saboteurs: Sycophantic LLMs Mislead Novices in Problem-Solving Tasks" class="ltx_ref" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">G.2</span></a><span id="A7.p2.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> shows the breakdown of the confidence-weighted accuracy by each question on the mental model quiz. We expect the pre-chatbot ratings to be similar across the two chatbots. We observe that the </span><span id="A7.p2.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0080FF;">Low<span id="A7.p2.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_serif"> </span>Sycophancy</span><span id="A7.p2.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> chatbot induces a larger positive change in certain questions, such as Q8, Q9, and Q12, while </span><span id="A7.p2.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#9933CC;">High<span id="A7.p2.1.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_serif"> </span>Sycophancy</span><span id="A7.p2.1.6" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> does not.</span></p>
</div>
<figure id="A7.F2" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2510.03667v1/mental_model_v2.svg" id="A7.F2.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:429/167;" width="429" height="167"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A7.F2.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure G.2</span>. </span><span id="A7.F2.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Pre- and post-chatbot confidence ratings for each statement in the mental model quiz, averaged across the two tasks and all participants. A positive confidence rating indicates a correct belief.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
</section>
<section id="A8" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix H </span>Additional RQ2 Results</h2>

<figure id="A8.T1" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A8.T1.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table H.1</span>. </span><span id="A8.T1.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Summary of Cohen’s kappa values for inter-rater reliability evaluation of the workflow code categories, as well as the macro- and micro-averaged values.</span></figcaption>
<table id="A8.T1.7" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="A8.T1.7.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A8.T1.7.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_th_row ltx_border_tt" style="padding-top:1.5pt;padding-bottom:1.5pt;"><span id="A8.T1.7.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Code Category</span></th>
<th id="A8.T1.7.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt" style="padding-top:1.5pt;padding-bottom:1.5pt;"><span id="A8.T1.7.1.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Cohen’s kappa</span></th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A8.T1.7.2" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A8.T1.7.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:1.5pt;padding-bottom:1.5pt;"><span id="A8.T1.7.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">User Query Action</span></th>
<td id="A8.T1.7.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:1.5pt;padding-bottom:1.5pt;"><math id="A8.T1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\kappa=0.74" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">κ</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0.74</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\kappa=0.74</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
<tr id="A8.T1.7.3" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A8.T1.7.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_row" style="padding-top:1.5pt;padding-bottom:1.5pt;"><span id="A8.T1.7.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Chatbot Response Action</span></th>
<td id="A8.T1.7.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="padding-top:1.5pt;padding-bottom:1.5pt;"><math id="A8.T1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\kappa=0.68" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">κ</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0.68</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\kappa=0.68</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
<tr id="A8.T1.7.4" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A8.T1.7.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_row" style="padding-top:1.5pt;padding-bottom:1.5pt;"><span id="A8.T1.7.4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Chatbot Response Outcome</span></th>
<td id="A8.T1.7.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="padding-top:1.5pt;padding-bottom:1.5pt;"><math id="A8.T1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\kappa=0.74" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">κ</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0.74</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\kappa=0.74</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
<tr id="A8.T1.7.5" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A8.T1.7.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_row" style="padding-top:1.5pt;padding-bottom:1.5pt;"><span id="A8.T1.7.5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Code Change Action</span></th>
<td id="A8.T1.7.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="padding-top:1.5pt;padding-bottom:1.5pt;"><math id="A8.T1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\kappa=0.82" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">κ</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0.82</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\kappa=0.82</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
<tr id="A8.T1.7.6" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A8.T1.7.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_row" style="padding-top:1.5pt;padding-bottom:1.5pt;"><span id="A8.T1.7.6.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Code Change Outcome</span></th>
<td id="A8.T1.7.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="padding-top:1.5pt;padding-bottom:1.5pt;"><math id="A8.T1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\kappa=0.58" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">κ</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0.58</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\kappa=0.58</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
